---
source: crates/rtf-orchestrator-ui/src/templates/run.rs
expression: render_fragment!(cancellable_run().as_cancel())
---



<p class="error-box">run is no longer in flight</p>



<div id="cancel-run-confirm" popover>
    <p>Cancel <strong>nightly-smoke</strong>? All of its in-flight executions will be stopped. This
        can't be undone.</p>
    <form method="post" action="/ui/run/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/cancel">
        <button type="submit" class="danger">Cancel run</button>
        <button type="button" popovertarget="cancel-run-confirm" popovertargetaction="hide">Keep
            running</button>
    </form>
</div>
